sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant Client as Public Client
    participant AS as Authorization Server
    participant API as Resource Server API

    Client->>Client: Create code_verifier
    Client->>Client: Create code_challenge = BASE64URL(SHA256(code_verifier))
    User->>Client: Start OAuth flow
    Client->>Browser: Redirect to /authorize
    Browser->>AS: GET /authorize<br/>code_challenge + code_challenge_method=S256 + state
    AS->>User: Authenticate and ask consent
    User->>AS: Approve access
    AS->>Browser: Redirect to redirect_uri<br/>code + state
    Browser->>Client: Callback with code + state
    Client->>Client: Verify state
    Client->>AS: POST /token<br/>code + redirect_uri + code_verifier
    AS->>AS: Verify SHA256(code_verifier)<br/>matches stored code_challenge
    AS->>Client: access_token
    Client->>API: API request<br/>Authorization: Bearer access_token
    API->>Client: Protected resource
